##RenderMan RIB-Structure 1.0
version 3.03
Hider "raytrace"
Display "p-vis-flagged.tif" "file" "rgba"
Projection "perspective" "fov" 50
Format 256 256 1
PixelSamples 2 2
Clipping 0.1 1000
Translate 0 0 9
Rotate -40 1 0 0
WorldBegin
    LightSource "vis_probe" 1 "from" [0 4 0] "intensity" [0.8]
    AttributeBegin
        Attribute "visibility" "int transmission" [1]
        Color [0.8 0.2 0.2]
        Surface "matte"
        Translate 0 2 0
        Rotate 90 1 0 0
        Disk 0 0.8 360
    AttributeEnd
    AttributeBegin
        Color [0.7 0.7 0.7]
        Surface "matte"
        Polygon "P" [-6 0 -6  6 0 -6  6 0 6  -6 0 6]
    AttributeEnd
WorldEnd
